Udata gains bool may_gc after len; luaS_newudata sets it, newproxy clears it, GCTM honours it;
newproxy rejects metatable-proxy arguments.

Justification (PLAYER bytes): luaS_newudata 0x0098cec0 stores byte [u+0x14] = 1 after env;
luaB_newproxy 0x008b0250 stores byte [userdata-4] = 0 (= header+0x14) right after lua_newuserdata
and its non-boolean branch is just luaL_error(L, "newproxy only supports the arguments nil and true")
(string 0x00b861ec); GCTM 0x009898b0 returns early when byte [udata+0x14] == 0 after finding a __gc
tag method. lbaselib.c includes lobject.h for the Udata type.

